Z||000000||fierospeeder||03-27-2001||03:49 PM||||So im off to go to school, community college, cause i messed up with real school.<P>I know im going to make it on time after hanging out at my g/fs house.  <P>Im driving on a busy road ogden for people in illinois.  And i take a right on a street that goes through a car dealership.  There are about 5 cars in the left lane and i stop behind them to take my left turn also.  This turn takes you on warrenville, i believe.  <P>Everyone turns and gets into the right lane, like most drivers do.  I turn in the the left lane, being a two lane road.  The 4 or 5 cars are all bumper to bumper while im driving my 10 over, limit 45, im going 55.  I finally catch up to them and i pass all of them in my lane.  Im going over a bridge and i look in my mirror this guy is turning into the left turn then passing those 4 cars and going back into the right lane.  <P>This is probably in the annoying drivers post in the other section.  But every a$$hole does this.  So the guy speeds up and catches up to me and just stays about a car length ahead of my.  his rear bumper matching my front bumper.  No hes not going any faster just staying the same speed as me.  Most would think after accelerating you would stay at the speed.<P>After 4 blocks est., i have to take a right turn, i use my signal, and turn and get behind him.  There is a turning lane for right turns and i use my signal again and merge.  This jack... uses his signal and does those i turn in the middle of the right turn lane, a lot of people do that here, so i back off a tad. <P> Theres traffic so he takes a while and finally turns into the right lane.  I get my chance and i turn, i turn into the left lane, because i have to turn farther up.  <BR>I gun it, in my tbird turbo, the limit is 45, i come up to the guy, he has a blue ford escort? wagon.  Right when im going to pass him, this jag.....  turns right in front of me without a signal, and im about to hit his door, i felt i should have.  And i hit my brakes hard.  Im f*c* (note kids reading this wont know what that means, wait its the 2001), pissed off, and i get into the right lane and i pass him, i turn left to get into the left lane, and hes about 3-4 car lengths behind me.  <P>I merge into the left turn lane to take my left turn, and this guy is behind me and does the same.  There are people in front of me.  The arrow light turns green and i move on.  Its single road for about 6 blocks.  The guy is keeping his distance, and there is an intersection with a light. The guy stops right up my ass.  <P>The light turns green, im about 6 blocks from school, the single lane turns into two.  I use my signal, and turn in the left lane and gun it.  This jack is following me but hes about 5 car lengths away.   I have to take a left turn, and theres a turn lane for people going to school.  There is a light, and its red.  There are two people in front of me.  No one is in the left lane, and the idiot, stops three car lengths short, so he can be window to window to me.  I had my finger ready, he was almost window to window to me but not perfect that he can see me.  Hes blocking traffic because he wants to play some game, in his lane.  I notice the light is green, and the cars in my lane are turning left.  I gun it and turn left, and hes not paying attention is blocking traffic for the people behind him. <P>I didn't give him the finger, but it feels good enough to ignore him, and make him look like an idiot stopping 3 car lengths behind the light.   I didn't honk at him.  If my g/f was in the car she would have rolled the window down and say something vulgar, shes done that before.<P>Please forgive me for spelling errors and grammer, I have to inform cliff to install spell check and grammer check like MS Office.<P>This guy was in his 40-50s, im thinking.  Im not saying its an age thing.  It does scare me in ways, that i drive a motorcycle and ive read things about roadrage with them.  Some people shouldn't drive, uh oh i might get flamed.  <P>||||reg||1
Z||000001||Cheever2||03-27-2001||04:50 PM||||Sounds like you did the best you could.  I probably would have pulled over, gotten out and used a "come on" motion to dare him to do the same.  Some cowards need to be pulled out of their car (through the window) & put on the sidewalk to wait for the ambulance that they're going to need.  Sorry, but reading that reminds me of times when I wish I'd done certain things.<P>And maybe it's best that Cliff doesn't have a spelling & grammar checker on here.<BR>  ||||reg||1
