Z||000003||Taijiguy||03-28-2001||09:57 PM||||I was on my way home one day, coming through a residential area. Some goof in Civic is puttering along about 10 mile and hour, and I'm stuck behind him. I'm not in a *huge* hurry, so I just sort of drove along behind him. This tune I play on guitar comes on "Blue on Black" I crank it to 10, and I'm singing and jamming, trying to stay calm while I wait for my turn to come up. Finally I get to my turn off, and go right. I see this goober jerk his car to the side of the road on the other side of the intersection. Next thing I know, he's behind me by about 50 yards.<BR>I turn onto my street, and come down the hill, and there he is. It dawns on me this moron is following me to my house. So I pull in the driveway, and I see him pull up in front. I have a minute to decide what I'm gonna do. I was in my work truck, so there was my trusty 22 oz. claw hammer right there in my belt on the floor. Then there was the police issue pepper spray in the console, and I finally settled on the 4 cell Mag-Light under the seat. <BR>I grab it so the handle is just barely visible in my hand. I get out and start towards my door, and this clown walks up with a menacing look on his face. I turn around and make sure he can see the Mag-Light. He stops about ten feet away and with this really angry voice he asks if I have something to say to him. I asked what was he talking about. He says back on the main road he could see me back there yelling. I started laughing, I said "You bonehead, I was *SINGING*!"<BR>He hesitated a minute and says; "yeah, OK" and walked away. <BR>Afterwards I thought he was lucky as hell I'm not a guy with something to prove, or who just likes to inflict pain on others. I have a neighbor, Travis, who's the craziest SOB I ever knew, and it could have just as easily been him this guy followed home. And I guarentee, Travis would have come out armed with the pepper spray *AND* his claw hammer. (not that he'd need either one, he's a tough bastard) He'd have maced the guy first and then beat him into a bloody mess. There would have been no conversation. He would have just walked right over and started to hurt the guy. You gotta be careful, you have no idea what people are  capable of.||||reg||1
Z||000004||Cheever2||03-28-2001||10:40 PM||||He won't last long if he gets that upset by people yelling.<P>I wouldn't pull up to my own house in a situation like that, I'd stop at one or two houses down.  For one thing, if he ever comes back for revenge he'll go to the wrong place.  For another, someone may be inside may come out and you'll have help or witnesses.<BR>||||reg||6
